# CodeAlpha_LanguageTranslator

Language Translation Tool built for the CodeAlpha AI Internship (Task 1).

## Features
- Enter text and choose source (or auto-detect) and target languages
- Translation via Google Translate (`deep-translator`)
- Copy button on the result
- Optional text-to-speech (`gTTS`)

## Setup
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
```

## Tech
Python, Streamlit, deep-translator, gTTS
